sans mt-1\">Pick up fresh at Lazimpat or receive home delivery within Kathmandu.</p></div><div class=\"bg-white border border-[#E6DFD5] p-12 rounded-xs text-center max-w-lg mx-auto\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shopping-bag w-12 h-12 text-[#1F3A2B]/50 mx-auto mb-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 10a4 4 0 0 1-8 0\"></path><path d=\"M3.103 6.034h17.794\"></path><path d=\"M3.4 5.467a2 2 0 0 0-.4 1.2V20a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V6.667a2 2 0 0 0-.4-1.2l-2-2.667A2 2 0 0 0 17 2H7a2 2 0 0 0-1.6.8z\"></path></svg><h2 class=\"font-serif text-2xl font-bold uppercase text-[#1F3A2B] mb-2\">Your Basket is Empty</h2><p class=\"text-xs text-[#5E6961] font-sans mb-6\">Add jars from our flavour collection before proceeding to checkout.</p><button class=\"px-6 py-3 bg-[#1F3A2B] text-white text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest font-sans rounded-xs hover:bg-[#2A4E3B] transition-colors\">Browse Flavours</button></div></main><footer class=\"bg-[#14261C] text-[#FBF9F5] border-t border-[#2A4E3B] pt-16 pb-12 px-6 sm:px-10\"><div class=\"max-w-6xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-12 pb-16 border-b border-white/10 items-start\"><div class=\"md:col-span-5 space-y-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 200 200\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"w-20 h-20 text-[#FBF9F5]\"><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"100\" r=\"92\" stroke=\"#FBF9F5\" stroke-width=\"3.5\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 2\"></circle><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"100\" r=\"82\" stroke=\"#FBF9F5\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></circle><g transform=\"translate(60, 60) scale(0.8)\"><path d=\"M15 15 L50 85 L85 15\" stroke=\"#FBF9F5\" stroke-width=\"9\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path><path d=\"M28 26 C 38 42, 42 60, 50 68 C 58 60, 62 42, 72 26\" stroke=\"#FBF9F5\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" opacity=\"0.75\"></path></g><path id=\"stampTextPath\" d=\"M 100, 100 m -68, 0 a 68,68 0 1,1 136,0 a 68,68 0 1,1 -136,0\" fill=\"none\"></path><text fill=\"#FBF9F5\" font-size=\"11\" font-family=\"serif\" letter-spacing=\"0.25em\" text-anchor=\"middle\"><textPath href=\"#stampTextPath\" startOffset=\"50%\">THE VANVASI PROJECT • LAZIMPAT •</textPath></text></svg><div><span class=\"font-serif tracking-[0.25em] text-sm uppercase text-[#FBF9F5] block font-semibold\">The Vanvasi Project</span><span class=\"text-[10px] tracking-[0.2em] uppercase font-sans text-[#E8B931] font-medium\">Himalayan Small-Batch Butters</span></div></div><p class=\"text-xs text-[#FBF9F5]/70 max-w-sm font-sans leading-relaxed\">Crafted in Kathmandu from pure cultured cream, wild honey, and mountain herbs. Each batch is uniquely charactered and dated.</p></div><div class=\"md:col-span-4 space-y-4\"><h4 class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-[#E8B931] font-sans font-semibold\">The Kitchen &amp; Workshop</h4><div class=\"space-y-2.5 text-xs text-[#FBF9F5]/80 font-sans\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-2.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-4 h-4 text-[#E8B931] flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><span>Nursery Road, Lazimpat, Kathmandu, Nepal</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock w-4 h-4 text-[#E8B931] flex-shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 6v6l4 2\"></path></svg><span>Pickup: 10:00 AM – 6:00 PM (Sun – Fri)</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-phone w-4 h-4 text-[#E8B931] flex-shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M13.832 16.568a1 1 0 0 0 1.213-.303l.355-.465A2 2 0 0 1 17 15h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A18 18 0 0 1 2 4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-.8 1.6l-.468.351a1 1 0 0 0-.292 1.233 14 14 0 0 0 6.392 6.384\"></path></svg><span>+977 9801234567</span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail w-4 h-4 text-[#E8B931] flex-shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m22 7-8.991 5.727a2 2 0 0 1-2.009 0L2 7\"></path><rect x=\"2\" y=\"4\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg><span>hello@thevanvasiproject.com.np</span></div></div></div><div class=\"md:col-span-3 space-y-4\"><h4 class=\"text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.25em] text-[#E8B931] font-sans font-semibold\">Quick Links</h4><ul class=\"space-y-2 text-xs font-sans text-[#FBF9F5]/80\"><li><a class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/#flavours\">The Flavour Characters</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/#story\">Our Himalayan Story</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:text-white transition-colors\" href=\"/#visit\">Kathmandu Delivery &amp; Pickup</a></li><li class=\"pt-2\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[#E8B931] hover:underline\" href=\"/admin\"><span>Kitchen Inventory Portal</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fil